  "folder": "02_Knowledge",
  "types": {
    "source": [
      {
        "severity": "S2",
        "issue": "The note's sole source is an internal homelab-wiki URL that cannot be resolved or verified, and it is the only evidence for the note's central factual claim.",
        "evidence": "Line 8 `url: \"https://wiki.homelab.local/forgejo/backup-design\"` is the only entry in `sources`, and line 30 repeats it as the only 'Sources / Further Reading' item. A fetch of that URL from the review environment returns a transport error (host does not resolve), so neither liveness nor content can be confirmed. Every other note in `./02_Knowledge/technologies/services/forgejo/` cites forgejo.org/codeberg.org instead (e.g. operations.md sources, lines 7-15).",
        "fix_hint": "Cite the authoritative upstream source: https://forgejo.org/docs/latest/admin/command-line/ — the `dump` command exposes `--skip-lfs-data` ('Skip LFS data'), which is the actual basis for the LFS claim. Keep the wiki page only as a supplementary homelab reference if it can be confirmed to exist."
      }
    ],
    "accuracy": [
      {
        "severity": "S2",
        "issue": "The note asserts a homelab event ('the storage layout was migrated in 2026') that the repo's own records show has not happened, and wrongly ties an upstream Forgejo default to that event.",
        "evidence": "Lines 24-26: 'The homelab wiki records that the dump has included LFS objects by default since the storage layout was migrated in 2026'. `./04_ADRs/320-adopt-forgejo.md` lines 79-80 state '> Deployment is not live yet', the ADR is still `status: draft`, and no `05_Implementations/**/forgejo` directory exists, so there is no migrated, running instance. Upstream, LFS data is included in `forgejo dump` unless `--skip-lfs-data` is passed (https://forgejo.org/docs/latest/admin/command-line/) — independent of any storage-layout migration.",
        "fix_hint": "Drop the 2026-migration causation and state the upstream rule directly: `forgejo dump` includes LFS data by default; pass `--skip-lfs-data` to omit it (cite the Forgejo CLI docs)."
      }
    ],
    "scope": [],
