        "fix_hint": "Add `last_audit_date: 2026-10-21` after `sources` (matching the sibling notes, e.g. `operations.md` line 16)."
      },
      {
        "severity": "S4",
        "issue": "Tags are not lowercase kebab-case; TitleCase and an underscore both violate the tag pattern.",
        "evidence": "Line 6: `tags: [Forgejo, Backup_Verification]`. Root `./AGENTS.md` requires 'Tags: lowercase kebab-case — `^[a-z0-9]+(-[a-z0-9]+)*$`', which rejects both the capitals and the `_`. Sibling notes comply: `operations.md` line 6 `[forgejo, operations, backup, restore, upgrade]`; `overview.md` line 6 `[git, forgejo, gitea, self-hosted, code-hosting]`.",
