One escalation for the hub: whether `https://wiki.homelab.local/forgejo/backup-design` exists and says what is claimed can only be settled by someone with access to the homelab LAN — I won't guess it. That unresolved item is why the verdict is `needs_recheck` rather than `issues`. Note also that `overlap` is empty by rule: no sibling drafts were supplied, so I did not judge duplication against the wider forgejo note set.
